  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improving productivity and climate resilience of small-holder livestock farmers in the Dominican Republic</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to strengthen national capacities to contribute to mitigating methane emissions from enteric fermentation through the promotion of climate-smart practices in the cattle ranching sector, with a Family Farming approach in vulnerable territories of the Northwest region of the Dominican Republic.</narrative>
